27:T8ef,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I travel privately from Makkah to Madinah?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. A private car takes your group from your Makkah hotel to your Madinah hotel — about 430 km, ~4 hr of driving — with no other pickups."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How long does it take, and what changes it?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"About ~4 hr of driving. Prayer stops, meals, traffic leaving Makkah and Umrah peaks add time. Tell the driver your preferred stops at the start."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can we stop for prayer and rest on the way?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Prayer, meal and rest stops can be planned when you book or agreed with the driver along the road."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Taxi, train or bus — which is better for a family?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A private car is door to door with all luggage in one vehicle and one fare for the group. The Haramain train is fast station to station but needs a transfer at each end and a ticket per person. See the comparison guide for details."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which vehicle should I choose?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A sedan suits one to three people with normal luggage. A GMC or full-size SUV, or a Hyundai Staria, suits families with more luggage. A Hiace van or coaster suits larger groups; coaches are arranged on request. We confirm the vehicle against your passenger and luggage count when we quote."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I book the return from Madinah to Makkah?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Tell us the return date and time when you book and both legs are quoted together, or add the return later on WhatsApp."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you drop me at Madinah Airport instead of a hotel?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Makkah to Madinah Airport is its own route, with the pickup timed from your flight."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I get a quote?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Send pickup, drop-off, date, passengers and luggage by the form or on WhatsApp. We reply with the vehicle and one fixed fare before anything is booked."}}]}1c:["$","div",null,{"className":"min-h-screen bg-[#FAFAF7] text-[#1C1C1C] pb-24","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"TouristTrip\",\"name\":\"Makkah to Madinah Transfer\",\"description\":\"Spiritual journey transfer connecting Makkah to the Prophet's City.\",\"provider\":{\"@id\":\"https://taxisaudiarabia.com/#taxiservice\"},\"itinerary\":{\"@type\":\"ItemList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"item\":{\"@type\":\"TouristAttraction\",\"name\":\"Makkah\"}},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"item\":{\"@type\":\"TouristAttraction\",\"name\":\"Madinah\"}}]}}"}}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$27"}}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://taxisaudiarabia.com/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Routes\",\"item\":\"https://taxisaudiarabia.com/routes\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Makkah to Madinah\",\"item\":\"https://taxisaudiarabia.com/routes/makkah-to-madinah\"}]}"}}],"$L28","$L29","$L2a",false,"$L2b",false]}]
